libc++ requires std::unique_ptr<T>'s default deleter to see a complete T at
destructor instantiation time, and -fforce-emit-vtables makes every TU that
includes DWARFLinkerCompileUnit.h emit CompileUnit's (implicit, inline)
destructor.  TUs that never include DependencyTracker.h then fail with:
Move the destructor out of line into the TU that already has the complete
definition.  Same class of fix as lld-21.1.8-libcxx-incomplete-unique-ptr.

